CompanyDivision.description:
A single company division.  Mirrors the CompanyDivisionList table in LVData.xsd;
consumed by the System Admin Dashboard Company Divisions tool.  The cs* columns are the
configurable custom-field slots carried by the division row.

EventSubscription.description:
A single event subscription.  Mirrors the EventSubscriptionList table in LVData.xsd;
consumed by the System Admin Dashboard Event Subscriptions tool.  The optional key
columns scope the subscription (by user, role, doc type, file, container, etc.).

DataQuery.description:
Root of the query for the data source.  First line should be SELECT TOP nnn, with one
field per line including its AS alias.  The WHERE clause may reference @pv,
@pD1 through @pD4, @pUID for the requesting user, and @pProject for the current project

WParamName.description:
SQL parameter name for the WHERE clause: @pv for the primary output filter,
@pD1 through @pD4 for values passed in via the depends-on list.  Certain names imply a
type - @pDateRangeN makes a date range, with WDefault giving the days back
